 /** @file
   Publish the FAT initrd from a Mu-Silicium FDT handoff as a read-only block device.
 
+  flashlm (LG V50) addition: if the FDT handoff yields no initrd, fall back
+  to the payload image carried inside the firmware volume. The LG ABL
+  rejects boot images with large ramdisks (mh2lm hardware finding), so on
+  LG devices the payload travels as an FFS file in the FV instead of in
+  the boot image's ramdisk. The FDT path is unchanged and always wins when
+  it produces a device.
+
   SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
 **/
 
